flowchart LR
  A[User] --> B[Open Login Page]
  B --> C[Enter Email + Password]
  C --> D[POST /api/auth/login]
  D --> E[Server: Find User by Email]
  E --> F{Password Match}
  F -- yes --> G[Generate JWT / Session]
  G --> H[Return token & user info]
  F -- no --> I[401 Unauthorized]
  G --> J[Optional: 2FA] --> K[2FA Verified]
  K --> L[Login Complete]
